<title>USA: Long Island Bancorp president retiring.</title>
<headline>Long Island Bancorp president retiring.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long Island Bancorp Inc said William Viklund is retiring from his position as president and chief operating officer effective September 30 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said Viklund's duties will be assumed by John Conefry Jr., Long Island Bancorp's chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
